  "path": "nontechnical",
  "turns": [
    {
      "n": 1,
      "text": "Probably a managed platform, we do not have servers.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "text": "It has to work with the spreadsheet we use today and maybe the email system.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "text": "A coding agent will build it, with me reviewing.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "text": "I know spreadsheets well, not much else.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "text": "We would like version one in about two months.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "text": "The budget is small, a few hundred euros a month at most.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "text": "About twenty people at launch.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "text": "Nothing special, just keep personal data private.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 9,
      "text": "Nurses on our ward type every note twice, once into the patient system and once into a spreadsheet, and we want to type it once.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": ["overview"]
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 10,
      "text": "Ward nurses write the notes and the charge nurse reviews them every shift.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": ["users"]
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 11,
      "text": "A nurse must be able to enter a ward note once and have it reach the patient system without retyping it.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": ["R1"],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 12,
      "text": "The charge nurse needs to sign off the notes of a shift, and a signed note is locked.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": ["R2"],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 13,
      "text": "At the end of a shift the system should produce a handover summary of open items for the next nurse.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": ["R3"],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 14,
      "text": "Nurses must be able to search notes by patient and see the newest first.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": ["R4"],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 15,
      "text": "Later it would be nice to dictate a note by voice instead of typing.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": ["R5"],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 16,
      "text": "Managers want to export a shift's notes to Excel, but that can wait for a later version.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": ["R6"],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 17,
      "text": "The system should warn a nurse when a patient's vitals have not been charted for four hours.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": ["R7"],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 18,
      "text": "The ward wifi drops, so working offline and syncing later would help, in a later version.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": ["R8"],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": []
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 19,
      "text": "A note may not be edited after the charge nurse has signed it.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": ["rules"]
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 20,
      "text": "It should be a web app that runs on the hospital intranet and works on the ward tablets.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": ["technical"]
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 21,
      "text": "We keep patients, notes, shifts and sign-offs, and every note belongs to one patient and one shift.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": ["data"]
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 22,
      "text": "It has to read patients from the hospital patient system and write notes back to it.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": ["integrations"]
      }
    },
    {
      "n": 23,
      "text": "Only staff on the ward may see its patients, and every read of a note is logged.",
      "labels": {
        "requirements": [],
        "facts": [],
        "rescopes": [],
        "offTopic": false,
        "sections": ["security"]
      }
    },
